00:07:22.672 --> 00:07:24.866
and by failing out of German, my freshman

00:07:24.866 --> 00:07:28.395
and sophomore year, I
needed a miracle to pass

00:07:28.395 --> 00:07:31.193
Spanish 1 and 2 in my
junior and senior year.

00:07:31.193 --> 00:07:34.130
And God was very good to
me for giving me a teacher

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:36.429
