- [India] Oh, this is written.

00:11:22.005 --> 00:11:23.781
- You know, I don't know
your age, but again,

00:11:23.781 --> 00:11:28.748
if you're over 30, you were
sold on a world where it wasn't,

00:11:28.748 --> 00:11:31.083
I'm gonna go do my own thing, right?

00:11:31.083 --> 00:11:34.578
So now that we live in
that world, I actually feel

00:11:34.578 --> 00:11:36.620
that the kids that are going
to work for companies now

00:11:36.620 --> 00:11:40.057
